           _LEVEL    = level-off point 50 m before RELEASE at the release height.
           RELEASE   = where the hatch opens, computed by nav_drop from wind, ground speed,
                       fall height and TRIGGER_DELAY. Its height here is irrelevant.
           _DROPTURN = base turn circle centre beside START (east side, open meadow).
           _CLIMBOUT = 170 m past DROP in the lane at 35 m.
         The waypoint names START and RELEASE are REQUIRED by the nav_drop module. -->
    <waypoint name="DROP" lat="48.81045" lon="7.85170" height="0."/>
    <waypoint name="START" lat="48.80990" lon="7.85170" height="15."/>
